    {
      "_id": "PHE9sHFDCMNZuASe",
      "name": "Broker",
      "type": "class",
      "img": "icons/svg/sound.svg",
      "system": {
        "category": "calling",
        "identifier": "calling-broker",
        "source": "Callings",
        "tags": [
          "calling",
          "broker",
          "presence"
        ],
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><em>\"There is no problem two reasonable parties can't monetize.\"</em></p><p><strong>Broker</strong> is the Presence Calling \u2014 the trade that kept its bearers alive after the Shattering. Umbrella: merchant, envoy, entertainer, cult recruiter, gang face. A profession is a flavor label on the Calling.</p><p><strong>Knack \u2014 Fair Price:</strong> The Broker moves any negotiated price <strong>5% per tier</strong> in their side's favor inside the \u00b125% tolerance band (Tier IV: the full \u00b120% swing).</p><p><strong>Aptitude kit:</strong> signature aptitude <strong>Diplomacy</strong> rank = tier; secondary <strong>Empathy</strong> rank = tier \u2212 1.</p><p><strong>Services:</strong> a standard job costs the tier fee (T1 10 / T2 30 / T3 90 / T4 270 marks), paid in <strong>Diplomacy or Soft Power (GM picks by job)</strong> marks. Cross-pool \u00d71.5 friction applies as usual.</p><p><strong>Tiers:</strong> Apprentice \u2192 Initiate \u2192 Master \u2192 Archon. Grant the matching tier features alongside this class item.</p><p><strong>Awakens into:</strong> Harmony Marshal. A Steward is a Calling that ignited into a Path \u2014 Surge is the mark of Stewardship, which is why no Calling banks or spends it.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        }
      },
